# =============================================================================
# Docker 构建上下文排除表
# =============================================================================
# 目标：让 `docker build` 的上下文尽量小（本仓 `target/` 可达 9GB 量级）。

# --- 构建产物 ---------------------------------------------------------------
target/
src-tauri/target/
dist/
dist-*/
dist-ssr/
node_modules/
npm/platform/*/bin/
npm/bin/buddy-switch-*

# --- 版本控制与编辑器 -------------------------------------------------------
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# --- 运行时数据（绝不能进镜像：含账号库与备份）------------------------------
accounts.json
backups/
*.log
logs/
.qa-logs/
.qa-tmp/
.debug-tmp/
.playwright-mcp/
.verify-*.txt

# --- 密钥 / 签名 ------------------------------------------------------------
.key
*.sig
*.exe
*.msi
*.nsis.zip
deliverables/

# --- 本地工具目录（各 AI 助手 / 编辑器产生）---------------------------------
.trellis/
.codebuddy/
.cursor/
.agents/
.codex/
.grok/
.workbuddy/
.workbuddy-ai/
.codegraph/

# --- 文档与演示（不影响构建）------------------------------------------------
docs/
pic/
*.md
!crates/**/*.md

# --- 临时脚手架 -------------------------------------------------------------
_*.txt
_*.py
_*.png
_*.mjs
_*.cjs
